# VelChat prod flavor — PUBLIC build config only (never secrets).
# Production = `main` branch → Azure VM (velchat-vm, Central India, static 20.219.132.21)
# behind Caddy + Let's Encrypt. Topology `mono`: every feature group in ONE process behind
# ONE edge-gateway URL — clients never talk to a service host directly.
# Source of truth: D:\Velchat\docs\RUNBOOK.md §0b "Base URLs".
# NOTE: the VM auto-shuts down at 19:30 IST daily; start it before expecting a response.
ENV=prod
API_BASE_URL=https://velchat.duckdns.org
WS_URL=wss://velchat.duckdns.org/ws
